WEBVTT

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:11.400
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.740
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.370
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.870
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.460
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.090
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.640
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.350
by ridding you...

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:43.520
...of your other love?

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.110
At sunset,

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:50.610
when the children go home,

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.530
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:58.450
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.540
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.330
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.800
In a city without light,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.390
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:24.890
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:32.390 --> 00:01:37.390
I'm Kurata Sana, a TV personality
with Gekidan Komawari, and 6th grader.

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:40.430
Sagami Rei-kun, my former boyfriend.

00:01:40.430 --> 00:01:43.060
Now he's walking the path
to be a fantastic manager.

00:01:43.060 --> 00:01:46.730
My Aoki Laureate prize-winning Mama,
and Maro-chan, the chipmunk on her head.

00:01:46.730 --> 00:01:48.940
The white bat, who's thrilled
to have a name settled on.

00:01:48.940 --> 00:01:50.400
What was your name again...?

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:52.410
It's Babbit!

00:01:52.410 --> 00:01:56.810
Hayama Akito, my natural enemy.
Now, though, how should I put it...?

00:01:56.810 --> 00:01:59.050
We're inescapably tied
to each other, I guess.

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:02.420
No one cares about me...

00:02:02.420 --> 00:02:05.750
Um... Hayama-kun...

00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:09.830
Tsuyoshi-kun isn't here today.
What could be the matter?

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:15.430
Sensei, have you heard
any word from Tsuyoshi?

00:02:15.430 --> 00:02:18.070
Ah, Hayama-kun,
something terrible has happened!

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:22.770
Hayama! What is it? What's wrong?
Are you leaving?

00:02:22.770 --> 00:02:24.440
It's Tsuyoshi!

00:02:24.440 --> 00:02:25.770
Tsuyoshi-kun...?

00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:28.110
Just come with me!

00:02:28.110 --> 00:02:30.180
What is it? What is it?

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:39.430
"My Name is Going To Change"

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:43.390
Hang on! What happened!? Tell me!

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:45.730
Spell it out so I know what's going on!

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:49.730
Tsuyoshi's parents got divorced.

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:51.060
Divorced!?

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:54.730
Sensei called Tsuyoshi's house a
little while ago, and his dad answered.

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:56.640
He said they'd gotten divorced,
that they'd left him,

00:02:56.640 --> 00:02:58.400
and that he didn't know
where they had gone.

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:00.740
You mean, Tsuyoshi-kun is gone?

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:04.410
Which is why I thought we should go over
to Tsuyoshi's house and see, right away.

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:05.740
All right...!

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:08.190
Let's go to Tsuyoshi-kun's house!

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:10.560
"Enter Tsuyoshi-kun's father!!"

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:16.090
What do you mean, you don't know
where Tsuyoshi-kun and the others went?

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:20.760
Yeah, I mean, we're divorced
and all, now. They're not my concern.

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:23.430
What kind of father is this!?

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:25.760
You may be divorced,
but you're still his dad, right!?

00:03:25.770 --> 00:03:29.770
The legal formalities are all completed,
so they're no longer family.

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:31.900
I gave them 50 million
in consolation money.

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:33.100
After that, I don't care.

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:34.230
"Sana and Hayama snap"

00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:38.380
--Money is not the issue here!
--Don't act so smug
over a measly 50 million!

00:03:38.380 --> 00:03:39.040
What?

00:03:39.050 --> 00:03:41.050
--Money is not the issue here!
--Don't act so smug over
a measly 50 million!

00:03:41.050 --> 00:03:43.050
Hey there, you're at odds.

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:46.720
You kids are pretty smart-alecky, huh?

00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:50.460
Shut up! You should at least know
where your own child lives, you...

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:52.060
over-the-hill cue ball!

00:03:52.060 --> 00:03:55.560
Hey, that's taking it a bit far.
At least he has a combov-[beep]...

00:03:58.060 --> 00:04:00.070
What did you call me!?

00:04:00.070 --> 00:04:03.740
Oh, look at the way he's losing it!
He's Tsuyoshi-kun's dad, all right!

00:04:03.740 --> 00:04:06.070
I dare you to say that again!

00:04:06.070 --> 00:04:07.410
I'll say it a hundred times!

00:04:07.410 --> 00:04:09.410
Over-the-hill cue ball!
Over-the-hill cue ball!

00:04:09.410 --> 00:04:11.080
When did you get your hands on that?

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:14.420
Shut up!!

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:20.090
Move out of the way!
You really are weak on defense.

00:04:20.090 --> 00:04:23.760
You rotten old fart!
Where did you send Tsuyoshi off to!?

00:04:23.760 --> 00:04:26.420
I told you! I don't know,
you miserable brat!

00:04:26.430 --> 00:04:29.090
Who needs an old man who doesn't
know where his own kid lives,
you dimwitted old coot!?

00:04:29.100 --> 00:04:30.760
This is no time to be
fighting with his dad!

00:04:30.760 --> 00:04:32.570
You call this guy a dad!?

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:36.700
If you don't know, then okay.
Sorry to bother you.

00:04:36.700 --> 00:04:38.370
Hey, you, hold it!

00:04:38.370 --> 00:04:39.370
Fine by me!

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:40.710
Enough, already!

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:43.040
Okay, now you've done it!
You're getting it back, and then some!

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:45.710
You think that's going
to work against an Oki!?

00:04:45.710 --> 00:04:47.380
Don't forget about me!

00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:50.050
And so it went on, and on, and on...

00:04:50.050 --> 00:04:54.050
So that's the kind of dad he has, huh?
I didn't know.

00:04:54.050 --> 00:04:57.390
Here, I got you a moistened handkerchief
to put on that forehead.

00:04:57.390 --> 00:05:00.060
Since way back...

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:05.060
Since way back, he's gotten himself hurt
in the strangest places.

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:08.940
His dad could have been going nuts
like that this whole time.

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:14.740
Mm-hmm, the way he snapped, yeah.
But if that's the case...

00:05:14.740 --> 00:05:17.080
I hate to think about it.

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:20.080
I never even asked him about it.

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:23.750
Lately, I haven't talked
to him all that much...

00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:26.080
Hayama...

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:28.420
That lousy old man...!

00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:33.020
Sure, he might be an over-the-hill
cue ball-- I mean, lousy old man,

00:05:33.030 --> 00:05:36.360
but as we were leaving his house earlier,

00:05:36.360 --> 00:05:40.740
his dad looked kind of lonely.

00:05:43.370 --> 00:05:47.680
Have you ever heard Tsuyoshi-kun
say anything bad about his father?

00:05:48.710 --> 00:05:50.040
No.

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:55.750
Where could Tsuyoshi-kun have gone?
He should have said something to us.

00:06:00.390 --> 00:06:03.940
What do you think you're doing!?

00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:03.960
"Bottom of shoe"

00:06:05.390 --> 00:06:07.560
You dirty letch...!

00:06:08.390 --> 00:06:10.730
It was right in front of my face.

00:06:10.730 --> 00:06:14.870
I'd forgotten! It's dangerous
to get too close to him!

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:21.070
Now I'll never find a husband, for sure!

00:06:21.070 --> 00:06:24.610
No, he didn't squeeze anything,
so I'm still safe!

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:26.440
"5 Yen"

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:40.330
Tsuyoshi could have gotten hurt, too.

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:46.040
He might not have said anything to me,
but what if he called over to your place?

00:06:47.370 --> 00:06:49.370
W- why, you...!

00:06:49.370 --> 00:06:53.280
You touch someone's breasts,
then pass it off like it was nothing...!

00:06:56.380 --> 00:07:00.040
Tsuyoshi-kun hasn't called my house yet.

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:04.430
If Tsuyoshi-kun does call, Rei-kun will
let me know over my Burutcha.

00:07:06.390 --> 00:07:09.050
Whoa! Don't come any closer!

00:07:09.050 --> 00:07:14.050
This body... This body has the future
of the Kurata family hanging on it.

00:07:15.730 --> 00:07:17.060
Hey!

00:07:17.060 --> 00:07:21.070
My dad's hospital is nearby,
so I'm going over there real quick.

00:07:21.070 --> 00:07:23.070
Wait up! I'm coming, too!

00:07:25.070 --> 00:07:26.400
Tsu--

00:07:26.410 --> 00:07:28.740
Akito-kun and Sana-chan!

00:07:28.740 --> 00:07:30.380
Thanks for coming by.

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:35.010
T- Tsuyoshi-kun, why...?

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:38.350
I was in the neighborhood
running an errand. Akito-kun,

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:40.020
I'm glad your father is feeling better.

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:42.520
Tsuyoshi, I ought to...

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:45.690
You weren't, by any chance,
worried about me?

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:48.360
We just went over to your house,
Tsuyoshi-kun.

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:52.600
Now, don't get too worked up.
The vein in your forehead is throbbing.

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:57.040
The signs had always been there,

00:07:57.040 --> 00:07:59.700
but I didn't think
they'd actually get divorced...

00:07:59.710 --> 00:08:02.370
We're almost done with all
of the finding a new apartment

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:03.710
and moving in and everything.

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:06.710
Now it's just a big hassle
putting all of our stuff away.

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:09.380
Once that was done,
I was going to tell you.

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:11.380
Is that 50...?

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:13.380
Once it's straightened up,
come on over and see it.

00:08:13.390 --> 00:08:14.720
Okay.

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:18.060
Say, we'll help you put everything away.

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:20.060
"We"?

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:21.730
Right! "We"!

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:23.060
Me, too?

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:26.150
"The Path to Being a Fantastic Manager"
by Obana Miho

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:24.050
You know,

00:08:24.050 --> 00:08:26.730
we should have a grown man there, too.

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:30.340
The manager that protects
and fosters his performers

00:08:30.340 --> 00:08:33.670
does so sometimes with sternness,
sometimes with kindness.

00:08:33.670 --> 00:08:36.570
An artist that defines
the culture of the day

00:08:36.580 --> 00:08:39.680
does so with serenity and congeniality.

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:42.590
Yes... I am a manager...

00:08:46.690 --> 00:08:51.020
Mother! Everyone said they would help!

00:08:51.020 --> 00:08:53.020
Wow, it's Sana-chan!

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:55.050
"Summer clothes 1"

00:08:53.030 --> 00:08:55.030
Wow, thanks so much.

00:08:55.030 --> 00:08:56.360
Aono-chan!

00:08:56.360 --> 00:08:59.030
Please let us handle the bigger boxes.

00:08:59.030 --> 00:09:00.700
"Us"?

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:04.040
Dosukoi! Dosukoi!

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:07.710
While I was out shopping,
I went to see Akito-kun's father.

00:09:07.710 --> 00:09:10.040
Oh, really? How was he doing?

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:10.710
He's fine.

00:09:10.710 --> 00:09:13.040
You don't say.
That's great news, Akito-kun.

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:14.710
Your chick is on the veranda!

00:09:14.710 --> 00:09:15.710
You're right.

00:09:15.710 --> 00:09:19.050
Wow, your brother made
a little house for it!

00:09:19.050 --> 00:09:23.050
Tsuyoshi, what should we give to
the neighbors when we greet them?

00:09:23.060 --> 00:09:28.060
Big Brother, what about Father?
When is Father coming?

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:30.060
Father is, you see...

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:32.330
um...

00:09:32.330 --> 00:09:36.670
From now on, Big Brother
will act as Father, too.

00:09:36.670 --> 00:09:39.410
But Big Brother, you've got hair!

00:09:40.340 --> 00:09:44.010
If you think that all dads are bald,
then you're greatly mistaken, squirt!

00:09:44.010 --> 00:09:47.680
There are all kinds of dads.
Bald dads, fat dads,

00:09:47.680 --> 00:09:49.680
annoying dads, dads that can fly...

00:09:49.680 --> 00:09:52.020
I wasn't talking to you, Akito.

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:54.690
Slimy dads, full-bodied dads...

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:56.020
You're starting to scare me!

00:09:56.020 --> 00:09:57.020
And even worse, there are--

00:09:57.020 --> 00:09:58.690
Cut it out, Akito-kun!

00:09:58.690 --> 00:10:01.030
Mother, I'm moving
the phone cord over here.

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:02.690
Tsuyoshi, where should I put this?

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:05.360
Ah! Akito is reading
Big Brother's manga!

00:10:05.360 --> 00:10:07.370
Why you, Hayama! Get to work!
Come on, come on!

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:09.370
Sana-chan, be careful with those!

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:10.030
What?

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:11.370
My keepsake glasses!

00:10:11.370 --> 00:10:12.370
Big Brother, hold this.

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:13.710
--Whoa! Don't carry so much!
--I'm throwing these away.

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:14.710
--Wait! Those aren't--
--There's no water!

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:16.040
--Open the shutoff valve.
--Where's the next volume of this manga?

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:17.380
--No, that one's for the gas.
--It's in that box on your left.

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:18.860
Get to work, Hayama!

00:10:20.380 --> 00:10:22.380
An insurance card?

00:10:22.380 --> 00:10:25.050
"Sasaki."

00:10:25.050 --> 00:10:29.720
That's right. He won't
be Oki Tsuyoshi anymore.

00:10:29.720 --> 00:10:32.460
Sure enough, his birthday is tomorrow.

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:41.330
Okay, everyone, please,
take a short break now.

00:10:41.330 --> 00:10:44.000
Yay! Apples! Apples!

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:45.340
We've got most of it put away, huh?

00:10:45.340 --> 00:10:46.670
You've been a big help.

00:10:46.670 --> 00:10:48.670
Huh? Where's Rei-kun?

00:10:48.670 --> 00:10:50.680
I want some apples, too...

00:10:50.680 --> 00:10:53.340
Moving is more fun
with a lot of people, huh?

00:10:53.350 --> 00:10:55.010
I wish we could move every day.

00:10:55.010 --> 00:10:57.680
Don't be crazy!

00:10:57.680 --> 00:11:00.720
I thought Tsuyoshi-kun
would be depressed,

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:02.690
but I'm glad he's in a good mood.

00:11:02.690 --> 00:11:04.790
Well, you hear about people
getting divorced a lot,

00:11:04.790 --> 00:11:06.460
and he appears to be okay, considering.

00:11:07.360 --> 00:11:09.360
All's well that ends well.

00:11:09.360 --> 00:11:12.030
Okay, you're coming to school
for sure tomorrow, right?

00:11:12.030 --> 00:11:14.030
Mm-hmm. Sorry to make you worry.

00:11:14.030 --> 00:11:15.370
Damn straight.

00:11:15.370 --> 00:11:17.440
You really helped us out today.

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:20.040
I thought it would take us a week
to get everything put away.

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:22.370
--It was no trouble at all.
--If you want to thank me, give me money--

00:11:22.370 --> 00:11:24.710
It was no trouble at all.

00:11:24.710 --> 00:11:26.380
Really, thanks a lot.

00:11:26.380 --> 00:11:30.520
Geez, Tsuyoshi-kun, you're so polite!

00:11:35.720 --> 00:11:39.030
T- Tsuyoshi-kun...

00:11:56.400 --> 00:11:58.110
Tsuyoshi-kun...

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:03.740
I- I bowed my head, and all this water
started coming out... I hate this...

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:05.740
B- be a man, and stop crying.

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:10.410
It's okay, Tsuyoshi-kun. We're the
only ones here. It's okay to cry!

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:15.420
I'm the oldest son... so, from now on...
from now on, I have to...

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:17.800
...I have to be strong...

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:23.760
Don't tell Aono or my mom, okay?
Don't tell them I was crying.

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:27.760
Mm-hmm! We won't tell! No way will
we tell! Neither me nor Hayama.

00:12:27.760 --> 00:12:30.430
He won't tell! He won't tell!
Hayama says he won't tell, either!

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:33.690
Tsuyoshi-kun, if there's anything
I can do, just tell me, okay?

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:35.350
Sana-chan...

00:12:35.350 --> 00:12:38.400
Don't go suffering all alone,
like you did this time.

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:40.030
Sana-chan...

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:41.030
Well then...

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:42.570
...be my wife?

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:46.200
Hey! Don't be presumptuous!

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:51.410
Ee-yow... I was just kidding...

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:53.790
Tsuyoshi-kun, I'll need
my husband to take my name,

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:56.380
so I can't be your wife,
but you can talk to me about anything.

00:12:56.380 --> 00:12:59.420
What does "taking your name" mean?

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:02.090
Tomorrow is your birthday, right?
For you.

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:04.720
Ah! That's the ¥5 coin you
picked up earlier! How cheap!

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:05.760
You're worse than cheap!

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:09.430
What can you buy for ¥5 nowadays!?
That won't even cover the sales tax!

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:11.720
Huh? This ¥5 coin...

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:15.850
"Showa 59 (1984)"

00:13:12.730 --> 00:13:15.770
It's from the year we were born.

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:18.940
Thanks, Akito-kun.

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:23.190
Well, even during just
our 12-year lifetimes,

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:25.110
a lot has happened, huh?

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:27.410
Mm-hmm.

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:29.450
Okay, see you tomorrow at school!

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:31.450
I'm free to talk to you, anytime!

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:33.700
Uh-huh!

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:34.710
I'm back!

00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:36.370
Welcome home, Sana.

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:37.710
Huh? We have a visitor?

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:40.710
Uh-huh. Sugita-san is here.

00:13:40.710 --> 00:13:42.710
Aya-chan?

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:46.050
Sana-chan, did you find out
anything about Tsuyoshi-kun?

00:13:46.050 --> 00:13:49.390
Mm-hmm. It turns out
he had to move suddenly.

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:50.050
Sensei!

00:13:50.050 --> 00:13:52.100
--How is your manuscript coming along?
--But Tsuyoshi-kun is right nearby.

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:54.060
He said he'll be at school tomorrow.

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:55.390
--Is that right?
--You're good at running away.

00:13:55.390 --> 00:13:58.060
--I still haven't caught you...
--So, Aya-chan, you came all the way
over here just for that?

00:13:58.060 --> 00:13:59.730
Mm-hmm.

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:03.730
Mm-mm! Sana-chan, you forgot
your bag at school, right?

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:08.070
Oh, right! Hayama grabbed my arm
without any warning, and all.

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:11.160
I've never seen Hayama-kun
panic like that.

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:15.410
Sana-chan...

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:18.750
Sana-chan, you're good friends
with Tsuyoshi-kun, right?

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:20.750
What do you think about Tsuyoshi-kun?

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:24.760
Tsuyoshi-kun, huh? Hmm, what kind
of animal does he remind me of...?

00:14:24.760 --> 00:14:29.220
Um, that's not what I mean.
Do you like Tsuyoshi-kun, or anything?

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:30.720
That's what I'm getting at.

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:34.350
Never mind! I was just asking.

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:37.680
Tsuyoshi-kun is going to have
a hard time of it from here on.

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:39.350
Hang in there, Tsuyoshi-kun.

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:42.690
Right now, all Sana can say to you is...

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:44.020
Over-the-hill cue ball!

00:14:44.020 --> 00:14:46.030
Not that!

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:48.030
Life has its clear days and cloudy days!

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:50.030
♪ Life has its clear days
and cloudy days! ♪

00:14:50.030 --> 00:14:52.030
♪ Rain will come in waves,
and snow will come in waves! ♪

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:54.030
♪ And while we're at it,
bums can be waved around, too! ♪

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:56.370
♪ Wavy-wavy-wave! ♪

00:14:56.370 --> 00:14:58.370
♪ Anyhow, don't give up, Tsuyoshi-kun! ♪

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:00.370
♪ You're strong, Tsuyoshi!
If you were weak, you'd be weak! ♪

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:02.710
--Sana-chan is strange, even at home.
--♪ Go, go, go, go, go! ♪

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:04.040
Bye now, Sana-chan!

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:07.050
See you at school tomorrow!

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:12.050
For Aya-chan to come all the way
over here to ask about Tsuyoshi-kun...

00:15:12.390 --> 00:15:15.390
Oh, I get it! Aya-chan...

00:15:15.390 --> 00:15:18.100
...is an extreme worrywart!

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:22.940
"That's not it"

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:22.940
Ooh, Sana dear, you're so dense!

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:29.400
And so, starting today,
my name will be Sasaki,

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:34.030
but I hope you'll continue to
regard me the same as you always have.

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:36.700
Tsuyoshi-kun...

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:41.370
Same old Tsuyoshi-kun as ever.
He really is strong.

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:43.040
Way to go, Tsuyoshi!

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:44.380
S- Sana-chan...

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:47.380
Okay, then, take your seat,
and let's start class.

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:49.720
Good for you, Tsuyoshi!

00:15:49.720 --> 00:15:52.380
Now you can cling to your mom
that much more tightly, can't you?

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:54.390
Yeah, yeah!

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:57.390
Tsuyoshi's mommy works the registers
part time at the supermarket,

00:15:57.390 --> 00:15:59.770
and always says "Thank you very much,
thank you very much, thank you very much,"

00:15:59.770 --> 00:16:01.060
three times, you know?

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:04.060
"Mommy, hold me!"

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:05.060
I'll bet you say that.

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:07.110
You've got such a mother complex,
Tsuyoshi!

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:10.820
He does not!

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:16.070
T- Tsuyoshi-kun does not
have a mother complex!

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:18.410
He just loves his mom, that's all!

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:21.750
A- Aya-chan...

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:24.420
That's one for the books--
Sugita raising her voice like that...

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:26.750
The quieter they are,
the scarier it is when they snap.

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:28.750
Tsuyoshi-kun has always been
affectionate toward his mom,

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:32.090
and he's a kind older brother
to his sister, Aono-chan!

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:34.340
I know, because of the papers
he's written about them!

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:35.760
Y- you don't mean...

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:39.010
Aya-chan, don't tell me that
the boy you're in love with is...

00:16:39.010 --> 00:16:41.350
I... I...

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:44.390
I love Tsuyoshi-kun!!

00:16:45.690 --> 00:16:47.360
Is that right, Aya-chan!?

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:48.690
Aren't you the slow one?

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:51.030
Oh! Sugita declared her love!

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:53.030
But Tsuyoshi likes Kurata, right?

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:55.700
That means there's a
love triangle going on! Awesome!

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:59.030
Fight! The girls are
going to start a fight!

00:16:59.030 --> 00:17:00.700
Hey...

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:02.700
What am I going to do?
I'm so embarrassed!

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:06.710
Whoa, Aya-chan, how long
have you had a thing for him?

00:17:06.710 --> 00:17:10.050
Everyone, are you aware that
we're in the middle of class?

00:17:10.050 --> 00:17:14.720
Tsuyoshi, Sugita would be a
better match for you than Kurata.

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:18.050
Think about it.
What's so good about Kurata?

00:17:18.050 --> 00:17:22.060
Kurata is a lot of trouble!
Sugita is calm and gentle.

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:25.730
Akito-kun, are you plotting something?

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:27.020
No...

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:32.360
Seriously, what's so good about Kurata?

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:33.650
Well...

00:17:33.650 --> 00:17:37.030
Last year, Sana-chan gave me
chocolate on Valentine's Day.

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:39.990
What are you talking about!?
Don't go making up stories!

00:17:39.990 --> 00:17:44.660
Listen, Tsuyoshi-kun, I didn't
even know you last Valentine's Day!

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:47.670
I was in a different class in 5th grade!
I didn't give you anything!

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:49.710
But you did!

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:52.380
Last year, as I recall...

00:17:52.380 --> 00:17:54.670
Right, right, all of the boys
in my class were nice guys,

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:56.050
--so I bought lots of chocolate.
--(Here! Here! Who wants chocolate!?)

00:17:56.050 --> 00:17:57.840
--After I got done handing them out,
there was one left over,
--(Chocolate! Chocolate! Chocolate!)

00:17:57.840 --> 00:17:59.720
--so I gave it to another boy
who was standing nearby...
--(Take it! Take it! Take it!)

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:01.350
Here! For you!
Congratulations on Valentine's Day!

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:03.220
What do you mean, "Congratulations"!?

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:09.060
That was you, Tsuyoshi-kun!?

00:18:09.060 --> 00:18:10.360
You're heartless.

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:14.400
Those were just random acts of chocolate,
without any decency or sentiment.

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:17.070
I had a hunch that's what it was...!

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:21.370
Who cares about me, anyway!?
Who cares about me!?

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:23.040
Whoa, Tsuyoshi's snapped again!

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:25.790
Class! Let's have class!

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:30.380
I've done a bad thing. To think
that that was Tsuyoshi-kun...

00:18:30.380 --> 00:18:31.750
It sure caught me out of balloons.

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:33.550
"Out of the blue," you mean.

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:37.380
Hayama is moving in on Aya-chan!
No, Aya-chan!

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:38.680
Getting close to him is dangerous!

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:40.340
Thanks.

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:43.010
L- looks like you're safe, Aya-chan...

00:18:43.010 --> 00:18:44.930
Ah, sorry, Sana-chan.

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:47.180
I'm in a hurry today,
so I'm leaving without you.

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:49.690
What did you say to Aya-chan?

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:53.020
I told her that today
is Tsuyoshi's birthday.

00:18:53.020 --> 00:18:56.030
Birthday? Oh...

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:59.030
Say, let's go with a
different program today!

00:18:59.030 --> 00:19:01.370
That's crazy. The set has
awlready been put together.

00:19:01.370 --> 00:19:02.700
The producer'll get mad at us.

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:05.700
Can't you do something about that?
Okay? Okay? It's a birthday day today!

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:07.370
Huh? Boithday, you say?

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:08.370
That's right!

00:19:08.370 --> 00:19:11.040
I see, well in that case,
let's have a royal blow-out of a show!

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:12.710
Thank you, Zenjiro-sensei!

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:15.050
Say no more! This one's for you,
Sana-chan!

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:17.380
Big Brother, happy birthday!

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:19.380
Wow! Thanks!

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:21.430
Things have been so
up-in-the-air this year.

00:19:21.430 --> 00:19:23.390
Sorry there aren't any presents.

00:19:23.390 --> 00:19:26.060
Mm-mm, that's okay.

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:29.060
Ah! Sana-chan is going to be on TV!

00:19:29.060 --> 00:19:32.060
That's okay. I'm over Sana-chan now.

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:35.980
You're over her? That's too bad.
I guess that's how it goes.

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:38.320
Yay! Sana-chan is on!

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:40.650
One, two, three...

00:19:40.650 --> 00:19:43.990
Happy birthday,

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:49.000
happy birthday to you!

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:53.330
Happy birthday,

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:57.340
happy birthday, Tsuyoshi-kun!

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:58.550
"Tsuyoshi-kun, happy birthday!!"

00:19:57.340 --> 00:19:58.670
Huh? Tsuyoshi? Who's that?

00:19:58.670 --> 00:20:00.340
--Sana-chan...
--Sana-chan, you mean
it's not your boithday?

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:02.680
No.

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:04.680
T- Tsuyoshi-kun...

00:20:04.680 --> 00:20:06.680
S- Sugita-san!

00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:10.640
U- um, I heard that
today was your birthday.

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:13.150
Here are some cookies I made myself.

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:15.360
Bye!

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:17.860
U- uh... Sugita-san...

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:23.070
"Keep hanging in there. Aya"

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:28.030
This week's Sana-chan and
this week's Zenjiro-chan.

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:30.700
Sana-chan...

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:35.290
I did used to like you, Sana-chan,
but I'm over it.

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:43.010
Now I think that Aya-chan
is better for me, you see.

00:20:43.010 --> 00:20:44.340
Good luck with Akito-kun.

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:46.680
Hold on, what is this?

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:50.350
Yesterday, Hayama-kun told me...

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:51.890
...that Tsuyoshi-kun was
a sucker for getting things,

00:20:51.890 --> 00:20:53.690
and so I should give him
a present for his birthday.

00:20:53.690 --> 00:20:56.020
So I baked him some cookies.

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:58.020
Sorry. Have you been waiting?

00:20:58.020 --> 00:20:59.360
Mm-mm! I just got here.

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:01.030
W- want to walk home together?

00:21:01.030 --> 00:21:03.700
Mm-hmm!

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:07.700
You sure do fall in
love easily, Tsuyoshi...

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:12.200
Between Rei-kun and Tsuyoshi-kun,
I might just lose all faith in men.

00:21:13.710 --> 00:21:16.330
Looks like your advice worked, huh?

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:20.380
That eliminates two rivals, now...

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:22.710
Hayama, did you just
snicker to yourself?

00:21:22.710 --> 00:21:24.050
No, not me.

00:21:24.050 --> 00:21:25.050
Okay, see you later.

00:21:25.050 --> 00:21:26.720
Tomorrow, at school.

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:28.550
Mm-hmm. Bye-bye.

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:34.060
Tsuyoshi... Heading home?

00:21:34.060 --> 00:21:36.730
Father...

00:21:36.730 --> 00:21:39.230
How did the move go?

00:21:40.070 --> 00:21:43.400
Some friends helped us out,
so it's almost done.

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:45.400
Oh, is that right?

00:21:45.400 --> 00:21:48.410
Father, how are you eating, and stuff?

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:51.410
Oh, I'm all right.

00:21:51.410 --> 00:21:55.410
Here. I just bought them.
Take them with you.

00:21:55.410 --> 00:21:57.750
Apples?

00:21:57.750 --> 00:22:01.170
Take care of Aono... and your mother.

00:22:03.090 --> 00:22:05.090
Mm-hmm.

00:22:05.090 --> 00:22:06.760
Bye, now.

00:22:06.760 --> 00:22:09.760
Father, you take care, too.

00:22:19.440 --> 00:22:20.900
Where's your dad?

00:22:23.320 --> 00:22:26.650
I know he's not around,
but why isn't he?

00:22:28.200 --> 00:22:30.740
You want to know about my dad?

00:22:40.750 --> 00:22:42.250
"Back against the wall."

00:22:42.750 --> 00:22:47.760
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:49.010 --> 00:22:52.510
In dire straits,

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:56.100
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:56.600 --> 00:22:59.980
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:23:00.940 --> 00:23:05.070
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:11.110
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:11.320 --> 00:23:13.280
...panic!!

00:23:14.280 --> 00:23:19.120
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:21.830
he's there.

00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:25.090
And our usual classroom...

00:23:25.300 --> 00:23:27.710
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:30.220
...for two.

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:33.680
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:38.430
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:39.350 --> 00:23:41.980
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:42.190 --> 00:23:46.730
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:52.320
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:54.990
he's there,

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:58.120
And our usual classroom...

00:23:58.410 --> 00:24:00.750
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:24:00.870 --> 00:24:03.250
...for two.

00:24:07.630 --> 00:24:10.630
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:10.670 --> 00:24:13.300
The summer of my promise
has come so suddenly!

00:24:13.340 --> 00:24:17.100
The time to fulfill the promise Mama
and I made when I was 5 has come...

00:24:17.100 --> 00:24:19.020
It's come... It's come!

00:24:19.020 --> 00:24:22.940
This is one serious promise!
What will be the fate of Kurata Sana!?

00:24:22.940 --> 00:24:24.940
Let's all do the limbo dance!

00:24:24.940 --> 00:24:27.150
Next time on Kodomo no Omocha,
Episode 14;

00:24:27.150 --> 00:24:29.280
at last, the fated series gets underway!

00:24:29.280 --> 00:24:33.610
"The Summer of My Promise -Part I"

00:24:33.610 --> 00:24:35.910
L- limbo dance...!?
